{
  "id": "ia-balcao-headers-variantes",
  "categoria": "header-ui",
  "conceito": "Quatro variantes de header para templates Blogger com Bootstrap 5.3: sticky-padrão, mega-menu, minimalista-centralizado e split (logo centro, nav dividida). Todos usam variáveis --sl-* e sem tags b: inline — o bloco fica dentro do b:includable no template.",

  "variante_sticky_padrao": {
    "descricao": "Header fixo no topo com logo à esquerda, nav à direita e botão hamburguer no mobile. Padrão para maioria dos nichos.",
    "html": "<header class=\"navbar navbar-expand-lg sticky-top shadow-sm py-2\" style=\"background:var(--sl-header-bg,#fff);z-index:1050\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <a class=\"navbar-brand fw-bold fs-4\" href=\"/\" style=\"color:var(--sl-primary)\">\n      <i class=\"bi bi-grid-3x3-gap-fill me-2\"></i>Nome do Blog\n    </a>\n    <button class=\"navbar-toggler border-0\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#navMain\">\n      <span class=\"navbar-toggler-icon\"></span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navMain\">\n      <ul class=\"navbar-nav ms-auto gap-1\" id=\"blogger-nav\">\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link fw-semibold\" href=\"/\">Início</a></li>\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link fw-semibold\" href=\"/p/sobre.html\">Sobre</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center ms-lg-3 mt-2 mt-lg-0 gap-2\">\n        <button id=\"darkModeToggle\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary rounded-circle p-1\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px\" type=\"button\">\n          <i class=\"bi bi-moon-stars-fill fs-6\"></i>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>",
    "css": ".navbar-nav .nav-link{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.3px;transition:color .2s}\n.navbar-nav .nav-link:hover{color:var(--sl-primary)}"
  },

  "variante_mega_menu": {
    "descricao": "Header com mega-menu que se abre em hover no desktop. Colunas de categorias. Funciona via CSS :hover puro (sem JS extra).",
    "html": "<header class=\"navbar navbar-expand-lg sticky-top shadow-sm\" style=\"background:var(--sl-header-bg,#fff);z-index:1050\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <a class=\"navbar-brand fw-bold fs-4\" href=\"/\" style=\"color:var(--sl-primary)\">Logo</a>\n    <button class=\"navbar-toggler border-0\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#navMega\">\n      <span class=\"navbar-toggler-icon\"></span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navMega\">\n      <ul class=\"navbar-nav ms-auto\">\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/\">Início</a></li>\n        <li class=\"nav-item sl-mega-parent position-relative\">\n          <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#\">Categorias <i class=\"bi bi-chevron-down small\"></i></a>\n          <div class=\"sl-mega-menu shadow rounded-3 p-4\">\n            <div class=\"row g-3\">\n              <div class=\"col-4\">\n                <h6 class=\"text-uppercase fw-bold small mb-2\" style=\"color:var(--sl-primary)\">Tech</h6>\n                <ul class=\"list-unstyled small\">\n                  <li><a class=\"text-decoration-none\" href=\"/search/label/android\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Android</a></li>\n                  <li><a class=\"text-decoration-none\" href=\"/search/label/ios\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">iOS</a></li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-4\">\n                <h6 class=\"text-uppercase fw-bold small mb-2\" style=\"color:var(--sl-primary)\">Dicas</h6>\n                <ul class=\"list-unstyled small\">\n                  <li><a class=\"text-decoration-none\" href=\"/search/label/tutorial\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Tutoriais</a></li>\n                  <li><a class=\"text-decoration-none\" href=\"/search/label/review\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Reviews</a></li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-4\">\n                <h6 class=\"text-uppercase fw-bold small mb-2\" style=\"color:var(--sl-primary)\">News</h6>\n                <ul class=\"list-unstyled small\">\n                  <li><a class=\"text-decoration-none\" href=\"/search/label/lancamentos\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Lançamentos</a></li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>",
    "css": ".sl-mega-parent:hover .sl-mega-menu{display:block!important}\n.sl-mega-menu{display:none;position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;min-width:480px;background:var(--sl-header-bg,#fff);z-index:1000;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.1)}\n@media(max-width:991px){.sl-mega-menu{position:static;min-width:100%;border:0;padding:0!important}}"
  },

  "variante_minimalista": {
    "descricao": "Header centralizado ultra-minimalista. Logo e nav no centro, sem ícones extra. Ideal para blogs pessoais e portfólios.",
    "html": "<header class=\"py-3 border-bottom\" style=\"background:var(--sl-header-bg,#fff)\">\n  <div class=\"container text-center\">\n    <a class=\"d-block fw-bold fs-2 mb-2 text-decoration-none\" href=\"/\" style=\"color:var(--sl-primary)\">Nome do Blog</a>\n    <nav>\n      <ul class=\"list-inline mb-0\">\n        <li class=\"list-inline-item\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold small\" href=\"/\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Início</a></li>\n        <li class=\"list-inline-item text-muted\">·</li>\n        <li class=\"list-inline-item\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold small\" href=\"/p/sobre.html\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Sobre</a></li>\n        <li class=\"list-inline-item text-muted\">·</li>\n        <li class=\"list-inline-item\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold small\" href=\"/p/contato.html\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Contato</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>",
    "css": "header a:hover{color:var(--sl-primary)!important;opacity:.8}"
  },

  "variante_split": {
    "descricao": "Nav split: links à esquerda, logo centralizado (absolute), ações à direita. Layout clássico de revistas e portais.",
    "html": "<header class=\"border-bottom py-2 position-relative\" style=\"background:var(--sl-header-bg,#fff)\">\n  <div class=\"container d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\">\n    <ul class=\"list-inline mb-0 d-none d-lg-flex gap-3\">\n      <li class=\"list-inline-item\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold small\" href=\"/\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Início</a></li>\n      <li class=\"list-inline-item\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold small\" href=\"/search/label/tech\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Tech</a></li>\n      <li class=\"list-inline-item\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold small\" href=\"/search/label/review\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Review</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <a class=\"position-lg-absolute start-50 translate-middle-x fw-bold fs-3 text-decoration-none\" href=\"/\" style=\"color:var(--sl-primary)\">LOGO</a>\n    <div class=\"d-flex gap-2 align-items-center\">\n      <button id=\"darkModeToggle\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary border-0 p-1\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"bi bi-moon-fill\"></i></button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm d-lg-none\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"offcanvas\" data-bs-target=\"#splitNav\">\n        <i class=\"bi bi-list fs-5\"></i>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"offcanvas offcanvas-start\" id=\"splitNav\">\n  <div class=\"offcanvas-header\">\n    <h5 class=\"offcanvas-title\" style=\"color:var(--sl-primary)\">Menu</h5>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" data-bs-dismiss=\"offcanvas\"></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"offcanvas-body\">\n    <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n      <li class=\"py-2 border-bottom\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"text-decoration-none\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Início</a></li>\n      <li class=\"py-2 border-bottom\"><a href=\"/search/label/tech\" class=\"text-decoration-none\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">Tech</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "css": "@media(min-width:992px){.position-lg-absolute{position:absolute!important}}"
  },

  "notas_tecnicas": [
    "Nunca colocar tags b: ou data: diretamente no HTML do bloco — esses campos ficam dentro do b:includable no template XML final",
    "id='blogger-nav' é necessário para o JS de dropdown dinâmico (links com prefixo _ viram subitens Bootstrap)",
    "z-index:1050 no sticky-top garante que o header fique acima de modals com z-index padrão 1040",
    "O mega-menu usa :hover CSS puro — sem addEventListener — para funcionar mesmo antes do DOMContentLoaded",
    "variante_split usa offcanvas Bootstrap para mobile — o id='splitNav' deve ser único por página",
    "darkModeToggle id deve ser consistente em todos os headers — o JS de dark mode busca por esse id"
  ]
}
